G-Mon said that it is possible to teleport away objects and monsters,
which can be achieved, e.g., by applying a wand of teleportation in the
direction of the respective objects or monsters. This is correct, and it
applies as well to all no-teleport levels.

APL said that it doesn't apply to creatures. This is wrong! And could be
verified easily in explore mode, BTW.

